$ 26016 v20 - extra WinGRAF picture W5: lowest buckling mode of PLC 119 (LC 9221) in v20, Level 1 framing (group 15).
$ Reads the COPY 26016_v20_copy.cdb. Pictures to wing_img2.

+PROG WING urs:11
HEAD 26016 v20 buckling mode 1 of PLC 119 - Level 1 framing (group 15), plan
DB 1 TITL '26016_v20_copy.cdb'
SIZE TYPE URS SC 0
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 0.001 Y 0 Z -1 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 15
$ img_0 = W5a: plan, mode LC 9221 magnified
LC 9221
DEFO TYPE YES FAC 40 LC CURR
STRU NUME FULL
DEFO NO
END

+PROG WING urs:12
HEAD 26016 v20 buckling mode 1 of PLC 119 - Level 1 framing (group 15)
DB 1 TITL '26016_v20_copy.cdb'
SIZE TYPE URS SC 0
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 15
$ img_1 = W5b: same mode, same view direction as W4
LC 9221
DEFO TYPE YES FAC 40 LC CURR
STRU NUME FULL
DEFO NO
END

+PROG PLBCONVERTER urs:19
HEAD export the WinGRAF pictures as PNG
IMG FNR 'wing_img2/img_%number%.%ext%' OVRT YES FMT PNG
END


